# Global instructions

Host-wide rules that hold in any repo. chezmoi generates this file: the shared rules
below are copied from `~/{{ $aw }}/instructions/global.md`, and the skills
they name are installed in `~/.agents/skills`, a link to `~/{{ $aw }}/skills/`.
After changing `global.md`, refresh this copy (omp reads it too) with
`chezmoi apply ~/.codex/AGENTS.md`.
Project-specific conventions belong in that project's own AGENTS.md, not here.

